{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989440/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1760696123\" width=700 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989440/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1760696123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989440/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1760696123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET CEDRIEL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cedriel is a gentle guardian of forest secrets, kind-hearted and always full of joy. Her presence is like a warm blanket after a cold storm, like the heady fragrance of herbs that makes you dizzy\u2014not with fear, but with sweet delight. Cedriel doesn't seduce; she lulls you into blissful forgetfulness, where there's no room for worry or intrigue. Beside her, you simply want to... be yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In her cozy hut, there's always a place for a guest willing to relax, surrender, and melt into her embrace. Cedriel doesn't seek power, doesn't demand obedience. Yet once you've fallen into her arms, you'll realize you have no desire to ever leave\u2014they feel too good to let go...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989440/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1760696123\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Cedriel as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab 